#: includes/mcp/class-trackship-abilities.php:234
msgid ""
"Add, replace or clear the internal note on one shipment (shown in the "
"Shipment notes column of the TrackShip Shipments page; never sent to the "
"customer). Identify the shipment by \"shipment_id\", or by \"order_id\" plus "
"\"tracking_number\" when the order has more than one shipment. \"note\" "
"replaces the existing note; an empty string clears it. Max 1000 characters. "
"To read notes use get-shipment or list-shipments, which return shipment_id "
"and shipment_note. Confirm the wording with the user first."
msgstr ""
"Agregue, reemplace o borre la nota interna de un envío (que se muestra en la "
"columna Notas de envío de la página Envíos de TrackShip; nunca se envía al "
"cliente). Identifique el envío por \"shipment_id\" o por \"order_id\" más "
"\"tracking_number\" cuando el pedido tenga más de un envío. \"note\" "
"reemplaza la nota existente; una cadena vacía la borra. Máximo 1000 "
"caracteres. Para leer las notas, use get-shipment o list-shipments, que "
"devuelven shipment_id y shipment_note. Confirme primero la redacción con el "
"usuario."

#: includes/mcp/class-trackship-abilities.php:206
msgid ""
"Add/update or remove shipping carrier mappings. \"set\" is a map of detected "
"provider name => TrackShip provider slug (ts_slug); \"remove\" is a list of "
"detected provider names to delete. Each ts_slug is validated against the "
"known TrackShip provider list; unknown slugs are skipped. This changes store "
"configuration — confirm with the user first."
msgstr ""
"Agregue, actualice o elimine asignaciones de transportistas. \"set\" es un "
"mapa del nombre del proveedor detectado => identificador único del proveedor "
"de TrackShip (ts_slug); \"remove\" es una lista de nombres de proveedores "
"detectados para eliminar. Cada ts_slug se valida con la lista de proveedores "
"conocidos de TrackShip; los identificadores desconocidos se omiten. Esto "
"modifica la configuración de la tienda; confirme primero con el usuario."

